  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wJgNb2w8/images/33468c96f882e0ba266b016cd1df944807fec4ea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"643\"><br></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">Gray's Mob Overhaul 是一款受 RPG 启发的生物重做整合包，为每种生物重新设计了多款自定义纹理。</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:18px\">1.19 - 1.20</span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">需要 OptiFine 或模组：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 必备</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span>使用了模组？请查看此处的村民模组支持附加组件<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grays-mob-overhaul-unofficial-compatibility-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组支持附加组件</a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grays-mob-overhaul-unofficial-compatibility-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里！</a></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">更多额外内容可在我的 </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/caninegray\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Patreon 上获取！</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><br></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>独立整合包：</em></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fbetter-cat-breeds%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">更棒的猫！</a><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fdynamic-horses%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">更棒的马</a><br><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fwild-wolves%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">荒野狼群</a><br><br></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fcozy-critters%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\">温馨小兽</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>教程：</em></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>由于 OptiFine 的更新和功能支持不一致，建议改用模组：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> &amp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></strong><br><br><strong><em>如果使用 OptiFine，请确保启用以下设置以获得完整功能：</em></strong><br>视频设置 -&gt; 品质 -&gt; 自定义实体模型：开启<br>随机实体 -&gt; 开启<br>发光纹理 -&gt; 开启<br><br>为防止纹理冲突，Gray's Mob Overhaul 应置于资源包列表的<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">最顶端</span>。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>许可协议</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><span style=\"color:#000\">本作品采用</span></span> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>知识共享署名-非商业性使用 4.0 国际许可协议</em></a><em>进行许可。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#2fcc71\">您可以自由：<br>- 将其添加到服务器<br>- 修改内容以供个人使用<br>- 在注明原作者的情况下分享</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e74c3c\">请勿：<br>- 重新上传或出售<br>- 修改、复制设计或声称拥有所有权<br>- 未经署名分享<br><br><span style=\"color:#000\">如有疑问，请通过私信联系作者获取授权。</span></span></p>\n</div>",
